      "content": "wait but if it was high an hour ago, wouldn't the insulin from earlier still be working? i'm scared that if i don't take a tiny bit more now, it'll just stay high and cause damage. can i just take 0.5 units to be safe? it seems like a small enough amount to avoid a crash but still fix the sugar issue.",
